@page "/"

<PageTitle>Index</PageTitle>

<div class="container">
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col-sm-12 col-md-6 col-lg-4">
            <div class="card border-0 shadow-sm rounded mb-4" style="background-color: #eaf5e5;">
                <div class="card-body text-center">
                    <h5 class="card-title mb-0">About MR</h5>
                    <span class="oi oi-info oi-3x mb-3 icon-lg"></span>
                    <p class="card-text">MR is a signature collective system for referendums. Our unique monetization model includes payment for publication and signature collection.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-sm-12 col-md-6 col-lg-4">
            <div class="card border-0 shadow-sm rounded mb-4" style="background-color: #d6edeb;">
                <div class="card-body text-center">
                    <h5 class="card-title mb-0">How big a problem does MR solve?</h5>
                    <span class="oi oi-people oi-3x mb-3 icon-lg"></span>
                    <p class="card-text">In Poland, 500,000 signatures from real people are required to submit a referendum. MR solves the problem of collecting signatures online from confirmed users, which has yet to be solved in modern democratic countries.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-sm-12 col-md-6 col-lg-4">
            <div class="card border-0 shadow-sm rounded mb-4" style="background-color: #c3e0c8;">
                <div class="card-body text-center">
                    <h5 class="card-title mb-0">The MR Business Model</h5>
                    <span class="oi oi-puzzle-piece oi-3x mb-3 icon-lg"></span>
                    <p class="card-text">Our business model includes a unique monetization strategy that hasn't been applied anywhere else, making it an edge case model. Join us in revolutionizing democracy!</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col-12">
            <ul class="nav justify-content-center">
                <li class="nav-item">
                    <NavLink href="" Match="NavLinkMatch.All" class="nav-link">
                        <div class="nav-link-container">
                            <span class="oi oi-home mr-2"></span>
                            Home
                        </div>
                    </NavLink>
                </li>
                <AuthorizeView>
                    <Authorized>
                        <li class="nav-item">
                            <NavLink href="create-payment" class="nav-link">
                                <div class="nav-link-container">
                                    <span class="oi oi-plus mr-2"></span>
                                    Add Payment
                                </div>
                            </NavLink>
                        </li>
                        <li class="nav-item">
                            <NavLink href="payments" class="nav-link">
                                <div class="nav-link-container">
                                    <span class="oi oi-list mr-2"></span>
                                    Payments
                                </div>
                            </NavLink>
                        </li>
                        <li class="nav-item">
                            <NavLink href="/admin/payments" class="nav-link">
                                <div class="nav-link-container">
                                    <span class="oi oi-wrench mr-2"></span>
                                    Admin Seed Payments
                                </div>
                            </NavLink>
                        </li>
                    </Authorized>
                </AuthorizeView>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>